{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅れてすみまめん！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/06/24/0581468/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まにぃ～～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パシフィコ横浜で個別握手会(*^^*)\n8th最後の握手会でした！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/06/24/0581468/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回から握手会体制がかなり変わったから、上半身しか見えない状態で下がどんなの着てるか全く見えなくないからちょっと残念、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身だとこんな感じだったんだよ！！！(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の握手会はほとんどがプリンシパルのお話だった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく良かった！とたくさん褒めてくれる方もいれば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと厳しい意見を言ってくれる方もいて、あみは愛されているんだなと思いました(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/06/24/0581468/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポニーテール❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして一昨日は寧々主演の映画「杉沢村都市伝説」の試写会にかなと一緒にお邪魔させていただきました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか怖かった～..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみとかなもホラー大好きだけど、\n終始怯えながら恐怖を楽しんでました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/06/24/0581468/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/06/24/0581468/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなも言ってたけどこれで乃木坂ホラー三部作も終わりなのかと思うとさみしいな～（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこれで終わりにならないように、また別の映画のお仕事が決まるようにね頑張らないとねっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/06/24/0581468/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々の映画、是非皆様観てくださいっ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして来週、再来週の乃木どこで私はきっと恥ずかしめにあう...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじはじの実。えーいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まああみあみ族は暖かく見守っていてください。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではではっと"}],"source":"archive"}